  "notes": "{横切|よこぎ}る means to cross or traverse something horizontally, going from one side to the other.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive)\n- Takes ⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧ particle: X⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{横切|よこぎ}る\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ⟦{道|みち}→道：00505_michi⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{横切|よこぎ}る: to cross the road\n- ⟦{庭|にわ}→庭：02239_niwa⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{横切|よこぎ}る: to cross the yard\n- ⟦{広場|ひろば}→広場：00104_hiroba⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{横切|よこぎ}る: to cross the square\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {横切|よこぎ}る: to cross (horizontally, from side to side)\n- ⟦{渡|わた}る→渡る：02441_wataru⟧: to cross (bridge, river, road)\n- ⟦{越|こ}える→越える：02099_koeru⟧: to cross over, go beyond (mountains, borders)\n- ⟦{通|とお}る→通る：01243_tooru⟧: to pass through\n\nETYMOLOGY:\n⟦{横|よこ}→横：02984_yoko⟧ (side/horizontal) + ⟦{切|き}る→切る：02693_kiru⟧ (to cut) - to 'cut across' something.",
